{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10643020","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10643020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1064302001:0":{"text":"各位远道而来的朋友！欢迎来到比赛现场！\n经过严格的资格确认，共有十六位来自伊索米亚各地的锻造者进入<style=\"highlight\">第一轮比赛</style>！","source_cn":"各位远道而来的朋友！欢迎来到比赛现场！\\n经过严格的资...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CB18798A242522F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064302002:0":{"text":"他们将迎来严酷的考验——车轮战！\n请听清规则！各位参赛者，你们有一天时间，使用<style=\"highlight\">官方材料</style>，制作一把<style=\"highlight\">连发火铳</style>！","source_cn":"他们将迎来严酷的考验——车轮战！\\n请听清规则！各位参...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2A27F47D54B5E0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064302003:0":{"text":"一天后，评委们将使用参赛者制作的火铳，射击多重标靶。穿透数量最多的前四位选手，方能晋级！","source_cn":"一天后，评委们将使用参赛者制作的火铳，射击多重标靶。穿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9C0BAC47475A412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064302004:0":{"text":"现在，我宣布——比赛，正式开始！","source_cn":"现在，我宣布——比赛，正式开始！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6887EBD9A51ADF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064302005:0":{"text":"随着比赛开始，参赛者们纷纷起身走进自己的工坊，开始时间紧张的锻造环节。","source_cn":"随着比赛开始，参赛者们纷纷起身走进自己的工坊，开始时间...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCEF16C4BF8DAFD2","varian